            "id": 82715,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa yang ditampilkan di console?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"light_intensity = [\" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"60\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(min(light_intensity))\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"60\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>60</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>500</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>[200, 500, 60, 90]</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>60</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Console di bawah menampilkan <code>60</code> untuk kode saat ini. Apa yang akan ditampilkan jika <code>60</code> dihapus dari <code>light_intensity</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"light_intensity = [\" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"60\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(min(light_intensity))\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"60\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>90</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>500</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>200</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>90</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Sorting strings",
            "id": 82743,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tulis kode <code>vocabulary.sort()</code> untuk mengurutkan kata-kata dalam vocabulary berdasarkan abjad.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"vocabulary = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;key&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;bridge&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;car&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"vocabulary.sort()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(vocabulary)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"55\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['bridge', 'car', 'key']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>vocabulary.sort()</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Ascending order",
            "id": 82734,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Angka mana yang akan menjadi angka pertama dalam daftar setelah diurutkan?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"featured_articles = [\" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"featured_articles.sort()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(featured_articles)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"[0, 1, 3, 5]\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>0</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>5</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Tidak ada, karena kode pengurutannya salah</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>0</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Setelah list diurutkan, nilai apa yang berada di indeks <code>2</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"featured_articles = [\" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"featured_articles.sort()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(featured_articles)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"[0, 1, 3, 5]\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>3</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>1</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>5</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>3</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
