          {
            "title": "Question: Sorting strings",
            "id": 82737,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Nama mana yang akan muncul pertama di <code>contacts</code> setelah pengurutan?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"contacts = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Ava&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Ana&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Bill&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"contacts.sort()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(contacts)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"['Ana', 'Ava', 'Bill']\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>\"Ana\"</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>\"Ava\"</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>\"Bill\"</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>\"Ana\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>\"Ava\"</code> dan <code>\"Ana\"</code> sama-sama diawali dengan <code>A</code>. Mengapa <code>sort()</code> menempatkan <code>\"Ana\"</code> lebih dulu?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"contacts = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Ava&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Ana&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Bill&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"contacts.sort()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(contacts)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"['Ana', 'Ava', 'Bill']\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Huruf kedua <code>n</code> berada sebelum <code>v</code>.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>sort()</code> membalik urutan penulisan nama-nama tersebut.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>sort()</code> menempatkan nama yang lebih pendek sebelum nama yang lebih panjang.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Huruf kedua <code>n</code> berada sebelum <code>v</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Method call",
            "id": 82860,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa yang salah dengan kode ini?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"cart = [\" /><text value=\"50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(cart.sum())\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Seharusnya <code>sum(cart)</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Kita tidak bisa menggunakan <code>sum()</code> karena <code>cart</code> bukan list</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Tidak ada yang salah dengan kodenya</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Seharusnya <code>sum(cart)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Pengganti baris kedua mana yang membuat kode menampilkan total keranjang, <code>87</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"cart = [\" /><text value=\"50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(cart.sum())\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>print(sum(cart))</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>print(max(cart))</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>print(cart.sum())</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>print(sum(cart))</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Method call",
            "id": 82864,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Buat kode untuk pernyataan display, lalu tampilkan jumlah dari list <code>points</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"points = [\" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"7\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(sum(points))\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"25\" /><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"38\" /><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"26\" /><option startIndex=\"30\" endIndex=\"36\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"sum\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"25\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>print</code>, diikuti oleh <code>(</code>, lalu <code>points</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tampilkan total list <code>points</code>, <code>25</code>. Tempatkan fungsi penjumlahan di dalam pemanggilan display.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"points = [\" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"7\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(sum(points))\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"25\" /><option startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"29\" /><option startIndex=\"29\" endIndex=\"30\" /><option startIndex=\"30\" endIndex=\"36\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"max\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"len\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"[\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"25\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>print</code>, diikuti oleh <code>sum</code>, <code>(</code>, dan terakhir <code>points</code>.</p></body></html>"
